        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Zombies Begin Here Festival returns to St Albans in 2026 just in time for Halloween!  After two successful years in 2023 and 2024, the festival continues to honour the bands’ extraordinary catalogue, their impact on generations of artists and their St Albans origins."
